Run date: {{DATE}} · run folder `{{RUN_FOLDER}}` · group: target `{{TARGET_GROUP_PK}}` · GBO source: {{GBO_SOURCE_ENV}} ·
agent `sigom-box-acc-configs-agent` phase 1 (no SQL written) · for the users' review with `02-acc-gap-matrix.md`.

**How BOX portfolio properties are built** ([ADR 0014](../../../../../docs/decisions/0014-box-acc-expert-review-1.md)):
the **shape** (conditions, topics per list) is the reference's BOX property; the **account** of each topic comes from
the target's **Valid** GBO portfolio properties of the same instrument (`InValid` ones are not read), through the
GBO → BOX topic mapping; **internal-list** topics take the internal account (`INTERNAL`). BOX consolidates: several
GBO properties usually end in one BOX property.

**Privacy:** PKs, condition functions and account codes only — no portfolio, counterparty or entity names or values,
no property descriptions.

